빈칸을 채워 API 클라이언트에 context manager(with 문) 지원을 추가하세요.

```python
class APIClient:
    def __init__(self, base_url, token):
        self.session = requests.Session()
        self.session.headers['Authorization'] = f'Bearer {token}'
        self.base_url = base_url

    def __enter__(self):
        return self

    def _____(self, exc_type, exc_val, exc_tb):
        self.session.close()
```

